Subject: [PATCH] Add optical FOD support

Restore the original optical mask lifecycle, DeX/AOD availability and
SurfaceFlinger debug-update enrollment guard in the Android-17 classes.
Use current resources, keep the current prompt/callback ABI and recycle
both Parcels on success, remote failure and exceptional exit.

